# Keep the build context to what the image needs: application code, assets,
# front controllers and the maintenance service. vendor/ is excluded on
# purpose, the production dependencies come from the base image, see
# docker/Dockerfile. Configuration and data are never part of the image.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.tokensave
tst
doc
vendor
data
cfg
node_modules
js/node_modules
js/test
js/nyc_output
*.md
*.tar.gz
.env
Makefile
compose.prod.yml
Evolutive.md
Evolutive-Bugfix.md
